sequenceDiagram

actor Alice
participant Nostr
actor Carol
participant Mint

Alice-->>Nostr: Generate new<br/>ephemeral PubKey
Alice->>Nostr: Publish Order

Nostr->>Carol: Fetches 8338 events<br/>Sees order
Carol-->>Nostr: Generate new<br/>ephemeral PubKey
Carol->>Alice: Sends DM<br/>with pay request<br/>via Nostr

Alice->>Carol: Generates H<br/>sends HTLC_c to PubKey
Carol-->>Mint: Verify HTLC_c
Carol->>Alice: Sends HTLC_a with the same H
Carol-->>Mint: Subscribe<br/>to HTLC_a
Alice->>Mint: Swaps HTLC_a token revealing preimage
Mint-->>Carol: State change with preimage
Carol->>Mint: Swaps HTLC_c token
